# specs/

The specification library for Claude Design's 54-asset taxonomy. Each spec defines standard shape, completion criteria, hard facts and dependencies. Used by `cdsync brief` to generate drops and by `cdsync check` to validate deliverables.

## Files

**Meta & Foundations**
- `library.md` -- master index; source for all spec validation, briefs, and bundles
- `kit.md` -- neutral design tokens; foundational import for all design assets

**Positioning, Strategy & Business**
- `positioning-icp-personas.md` -- market positioning, ICP, personas; founding asset
- `venture-thesis.md` -- the wedge hypothesis and disconfirming conditions
- `pitch-deck.md` -- 13-slide investor deck; standard sequence with speaker notes
- `pricing-and-packaging.md` -- unit, tiers, prices, tier boundaries
- `go-to-market-plan.md` -- channels, motion, segments, measurement, stop conditions
- `investor-update.md` -- monthly/quarterly recurring; metrics, wins, misses, asks
- `ways-of-working.md` -- decision rights, cadence, work tracking, escalation
- `whos-who-in-the-zoo.md` -- team, ownership, advisors, gaps, contact routing

**Information Architecture & Flows**
- `information-architecture.md` -- content types, sitemap, navigation, access, states
- `key-flows.md` -- journeys with branches, failures, boundaries, exit states
- `cms-rollout-plan.md` -- content model, migrations, editing permissions, handover

**Design Systems**
- `grid-and-layout.md` -- space scale, grid, breakpoints, density, hit targets
- `colour-system.md` -- ramps, semantic roles, modes, contrast record
- `typography-system.md` -- typefaces, scale, roles, line height, measure, density
- `design-system-index.md` -- front door, inventory, foundations, application boundary
- `component-library.md` -- 28-component standard inventory; anatomy, variants, usage
- `states-and-interaction.md` -- component states matrix and page-level state panels
- `logo-suite.md` -- master mark, variants, minimum size, clear space, prohibitions
- `brand-guidelines.md` -- assembled identity; logo, colour, type, voice, imagery, misuse
- `voice-and-tone.md` -- voice traits, tone by situation, do/don't pairs, vocabulary
- `imagery-direction.md` -- subject, treatment, composition, people, sourcing, rejects

**Customer-Facing & Marketing**
- `landing-page.md` -- one-page conversion; hero, problem, proof, objections, close
- `product-one-pager.md` -- single-page leave-behind; problem, proof, action
- `email-templates.md` -- triggered emails; subject, preview, structure, editable regions
- `social-and-ad-kit.md` -- platform tiles, grid rhythm, type treatment, evergreen set
- `print-collateral.md` -- leaflets, cards, posters; trim, bleed, type minimums
